Usage: gccli wellness jet-lag update <id> [flags]

Change the places or times of a jet lag trip.

Arguments:
  <id>    Trip ID.

Flags:
  -h, --help                  Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                  Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                 Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header                Print the column names as the first line of
                              --plain output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"          Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING        Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"          Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                              elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                              auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                              statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version               Print version information.

      --from=PLACE            New place of departure. The return flight arrives
                              there.
      --to=PLACE              New place of arrival. The return flight departs
                              there.
      --depart=TIME           New local departure time with the UTC offset,
                              such as 2026-11-02T10:00+01:00.
      --arrive=TIME           New local arrival time with the UTC offset.
      --return-depart=TIME    New local departure time of the return flight,
                              with the UTC offset.
      --return-arrive=TIME    New local arrival time of the return flight,
                              with the UTC offset.

